@startuml
' Figure 22-3: the zero-admission gate as a top-to-bottom flow. Each theory compiles
' and prints its assumptions (Closed, or the build halts); the Makefile gate self-tests
' the scanner and re-scans every source for the banned proof-incompleteness vernaculars.
' Rendered with rectangle fills (not activity nodes) so hex colors stay clean in the SVG.
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName monospaced
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
}
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
top to bottom direction

title Figure 22-3 — the zero-admission gate:  Print Assumptions => Closed => Makefile gate

rectangle "compile a campaign theory\n(rho_bridge / advanced_automata)" as COMPILE #C6E0F5
rectangle "Print Assumptions <thm>" as PRINT #C6E0F5
rectangle "reports\n\"Closed under the global context\" ?" as CLOSED #FDE9C8
rectangle "theory admitted to the corpus\n(310 total: 161 rho_bridge + 149 advanced_automata)" as CORPUS #A7D8B6
rectangle "BUILD HALTS —\nan axiom or admit leaked" as HALT1 #F6C177

rectangle "make rocq-critical-zero-admission\n(require-capped, 32 GiB ceiling)" as MAKE #C6E0F5
rectangle "check_rocq_zero_admission.py --self-test\n(5 fixtures must trip the scanner)" as SELFTEST #C6E0F5
rectangle "strip nested Rocq comments\n(line numbers preserved)" as STRIP #C6E0F5
rectangle "BANNED_COMMAND\nmatches any line head ?" as BANNED #FDE9C8
rectangle "FAIL: banned vernacular\n(assumption / conjecture / parameter / admission)" as FAIL #F6C177
rectangle "GATE PASSES —\nzero admissions across the corpus" as PASS #7FC79B

COMPILE --> PRINT
PRINT --> CLOSED
CLOSED -[#2F855A]-> CORPUS : "yes"
CLOSED -[#C05621]-> HALT1 : "no"
CORPUS --> MAKE
MAKE --> SELFTEST
SELFTEST --> STRIP
STRIP --> BANNED
BANNED -[#C05621]-> FAIL : "yes"
BANNED -[#2F855A]-> PASS : "no"

note right of PASS #EDF2F7
  The corpus's 310 "Closed under the global context" certificates plus
  this source scan are what make every Theorem in doc 22 trustworthy:
  no axiom, no conjecture, no parameter, no admission.
end note
@enduml
